OL,3,GNEWSA'If I can walk, I can dance' says
OL,4,A94-year-old viral hit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of elderly women have gone
OL,7,Fviral on social media, after staging a
OL,8,Fdance-off at their local seniors club.
OL,10,FJune and Julie, who are both in their
OL,11,F90s, were filmed dancing at the Coundon
OL,12,FCare Seniors Club in Coventry.
OL,14,FSince then, the video of them busting
OL,15,Fmoves and throwing shapes to the
OL,16,FBeatles hit, I Saw Her Standing There,
OL,17,Fhas been seen more than 70,000 times.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
