OL,3,GNEWSA'If I can walk, I can dance' says
OL,4,A94-year-old viral hit
OL,5,
OL,6,FJune Bowcott, 94, said being able to go
OL,7,Fto the dances put on by the club meant
OL,8,Fa great deal. "I like to make people
OL,9,Fhappy. If I can walk, I can dance," she
OL,10,Fsaid.
